# echo-path

echo-path is a single Git repository (monorepo) containing multiple, related
components. Do not split these into separate repositories.

## Repository structure

- `mobile-app/` — mobile client application.
- `smart-door-infra/` — infrastructure and deployment for the smart-door system.
- `backend/` — backend services and APIs.

## Conventions

- Keep all components inside this repository.
- Each top-level component owns its own dependencies, configuration, and tests.
- Prefer clear, self-contained changes scoped to a single component when possible.
